{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/blog/local-debian-mail","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Probably it all starts when I get lonely.</p>\n<h2 id=\"install\" style=\"position:relative;\">Install<a href=\"#install\" aria-label=\"install permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h2>\n<p>Install GNU mail</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">apt</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> mailutils\ndpkg-reconfigure exim4-config</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"add-notifications\" style=\"position:relative;\">Add notifications<a href=\"#add-notifications\" aria-label=\"add notifications permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h2>\n<p>Remove the mail check from ssh greeting editing <strong>/etc/pam.d/sshd</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\"># Print the status of the user's mailbox upon successful login.\n#session    optional     pam_mail.so standard noenv # [1]</code></pre></div>\n<p>Also remove the mail check from pam config (not when you login via ssh?) editing <strong>/etc/pam.d/login</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">#session    optional   pam_mail.so standard</code></pre></div>\n<p>And finally create our super greeting via <em>message of the day</em> script</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"token comment\"># nano /etc/update-motd.d/90-mail</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">#!/bin/sh</span>\n\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">mbox</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token variable\"><span class=\"token variable\">$(</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-un</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">$(</span>cat /proc/self/loginuid<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token variable\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"<span class=\"token variable\">$mbox</span>\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"root\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">then</span>\n    <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">mbox</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>mail\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fi</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">#echo \"whoiam: \"$(whoiam)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#echo \"id    : \"$(id -un)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#echo \"USER  : $USER\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#echo \"SSH_USER : $SSH_USER\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#echo \"loginuid: \"$(id -un $(cat /proc/self/loginuid))</span>\n\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">box_file</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>/var/mail/<span class=\"token variable\">$mbox</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-e</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"<span class=\"token variable\">$box_file</span>\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">||</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">exit</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">count</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token variable\"><span class=\"token variable\">$(</span><span class=\"token function\">grep</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-c</span> <span class=\"token string\">'^From '</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"<span class=\"token variable\">$box_file</span>\"</span><span class=\"token variable\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"<span class=\"token variable\">$count</span>\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-gt</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\n\">\\n</span>📬 You have <span class=\"token variable\">$count</span> mail message(s). Type 'mail -f /var/spool/mail/<span class=\"token variable\">$mbox</span>' to read.<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\n\">\\n</span>\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"quick-send\" style=\"position:relative;\">Quick send<a href=\"#quick-send\" aria-label=\"quick send permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Hello Tony, this is a test.\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> mail <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-s</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Test subject\"</span> tony\n<span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"I just installed 'mail' (mailutils). This is a test to check a new motd script :)\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> mail <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-s</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Test motd on root\"</span> root</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"mail-interactive-commands-cheat-sheet\" style=\"position:relative;\"><code class=\"language-text\">mail</code> interactive commands Cheat Sheet<a href=\"#mail-interactive-commands-cheat-sheet\" aria-label=\"mail interactive commands cheat sheet permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h2>\n<p>Usually you don't need to specify the file for your user. But just in case, this is where you can find it:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">mail <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-f</span> /var/spool/mail/nikolay</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">t &lt;n></code> – Type (show) message <em>n</em>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">n</code> – Show next message.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">h</code> – List message headers (current screenful).</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">z</code> – Show next screenful of headers.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">z-</code> – Show previous screenful of headers.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">p</code> – Print current message again.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">d &lt;n></code> – Delete message <em>n</em> (marks for deletion).</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">u &lt;n></code> – Undelete message <em>n</em>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">s &lt;n> file</code> – Save message <em>n</em> to a file (usually in <code class=\"language-text\">mbox</code> format).</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">w &lt;n> file</code> – Write message <em>n</em> to a file (just body, no headers).</li>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">x</code> – Exit without making changes (abort session).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">q</code> – Quit, saving changes (deleted messages removed, saved ones moved).</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">file filename</code> – Switch to another mailbox file.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">/string</code> – Search for messages containing <em>string</em>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">?</code> – Print help for commands.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sending--replying\" style=\"position:relative;\">Sending / Replying<a href=\"#sending--replying\" aria-label=\"sending  replying permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">m address</code> – Mail a message to <code class=\"language-text\">address</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">r</code> – Reply to sender.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">R</code> – Reply to sender <strong>and all recipients</strong>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">f</code> – Forward (resend) current message.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"special-notes\" style=\"position:relative;\">Special Notes<a href=\"#special-notes\" aria-label=\"special notes permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Messages are numbered within the current mailbox.</li>\n<li>You can give ranges: e.g., <code class=\"language-text\">d 1-5</code> deletes messages 1 through 5.</li>\n<li>Deleted messages aren’t removed until you quit (<code class=\"language-text\">q</code>).</li>\n</ul>","excerpt":"Probably it all starts when I get lonely. Install Install GNU mail Add notifications Remove the mail check from ssh greeting editing /etc…","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#install\">Install</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#add-notifications\">Add notifications</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#quick-send\">Quick send</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#mail-interactive-commands-cheat-sheet\"><code class=\"language-text\">mail</code> interactive commands Cheat Sheet</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#sending--replying\">Sending / Replying</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#special-notes\">Special Notes</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"socialcard":"gatsby-plugin-social-card/719b3a3b-e9cc-5d6e-b5cb-bc70573421ad.jpg"},"frontmatter":{"date":"August 18, 2025","published":"August 18, 2025","lastModified":"August 19, 2025","title":"Local Debian mail","subtitle":"Send mail from one user to another","section":null,"draft":null,"developing":null,"buttonText":null,"buttonLink":null,"secondButtonText":null,"secondButtonLink":null,"featuredImage":null}}},"pageContext":{"showLikes":true,"absolutePath":"/home/runner/work/mikolasan.github.io/mikolasan.github.io/src/markdown/blog/local-debian-mail.md","url":"/blog/local-debian-mail","next":{"excerpt":"I have 4 SSD drives in RAID0 array that were created with DELL storage controller on a DELL server. One drive failed, and now the server…","fileAbsolutePath":"/home/runner/work/mikolasan.github.io/mikolasan.github.io/src/markdown/blog/fix-raid-0.md","frontmatter":{"title":"Fix RAID 0","date":"2025-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","topic":null,"article":null},"id":"946215f2-d1b2-5a15-a5fa-e59e447ffd38"},"previous":{"excerpt":"To read Why do you ne